tr.td:
As follows:
(a) if this Act receives the Royal Assent on or before 20 July 2026—20 September 2026;
(b) if this Act receives the Royal Assent after 20 July 2026—the first 20 March or 20 September to occur after the end of the period of 3 months beginning on the day this Act receives the Royal Assent.
